--- !u!114 &1122688772
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1122688770}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 380dac98115ca4198a547173d253e0cf, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  dialogue:
    name: Wilson
    isEndGameDialogue: 0
    endGameTriggerTime: 5
    isFinalGameDialogue: 0
    finalGameTriggerTime: 5
    canDeleteObstacle: 1
    ObstaclesToDelete:
    - {fileID: 1482651455}
    - {fileID: 361025425}
    - {fileID: 1122688770}
    canActivateObject: 1
    objectToActivate:
    - {fileID: 2106850040}
    - {fileID: 956166431}
    haveNextDialogue: 0
    nextDialogue: {fileID: 0}
    nextDialogueCooldown: 5
    sentences:
    - speaker: Player
      lookTarget: {fileID: 1234303804}
      sentences: Who are you? What is this place?
    - speaker: Old Man
      lookTarget: {fileID: 0}
      sentences: "Stranger... \nYou shouldn't be here. "
    - speaker: Wilson
      lookTarget: {fileID: 0}
      sentences: "These grounds... \nThey weren't always like this. "
    - speaker: Wilson
      lookTarget: {fileID: 0}
      sentences: "Long ago, this was a thriving estate, built over ancient burial
        sites. But the floods came\u2014not natural ones. A curse awakened them.
        The waters rose, cracking the earth, and they crawled out... "
    - speaker: Wilson
      lookTarget: {fileID: 0}
      sentences: Twisted things, born of shadow and rage.
    - speaker: Player
      lookTarget: {fileID: 0}
      sentences: What happened to you?
    - speaker: Wilson
      lookTarget: {fileID: 0}
      sentences: "I was a fool. Came here seeking relics\u2014artifacts said to hold
        power over the curse. "
    - speaker: Wilson
      lookTarget: {fileID: 0}
      sentences: The ground gave way under me during the last storm. Trapped me in
        the depths. I barely escaped those...
    - speaker: Wilson
      lookTarget: {fileID: 0}
      sentences: Monsters.....
    - speaker: Wilson
      lookTarget: {fileID: 0}
      sentences: 'They roam blindly, but their gaze... it pierces like knives. One
        look, and you''re done. '
    - speaker: Wilson
      lookTarget: {fileID: 0}
      sentences: 'I can''t move far.

        But You....'
    - speaker: Wilson
      lookTarget: {fileID: 0}
      sentences: You seem strong. Unmarked by the flood yet.
    - speaker: Player
      lookTarget: {fileID: 0}
      sentences: Tell me more about the curse.
    - speaker: Wilson
      lookTarget: {fileID: 901164188}
      sentences: Let's go to my shack first. I'll tell you more in there.....
